<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bufete starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bufete starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings said on Wednesday analyst Hector Castillo had started coverage of Mexican construction company Bufete Industrial SA de CV with rating of hold.</p>
<p>-- Castillo wrote in a Feb 11 report, &quot;Since Oct 25, 1996, the stock has appreciated close to 40 percent in dollar terms, and it also presents one of the highest estimated 1997 P/E's among our basket of international construction companies, therefore we believe at this time there is limited upside potential and we rate Bufete a hold.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 1/8 to 21-1/2 in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
